<rules>
<rule id="9bd6-d457-50d5-3a81" name="Unmaking Gaze" hidden="false">
<description>Ruinstorm Psychic Power - Focused Witchfire, 12". If successfully invoked, resolve a single ranged attack with the profile shown; as a Focused Witchfire the normal rules for determining which model in the target unit is affected apply.</description>
</rule>
</rules>
